---
description: Calle design-system rules for UI work in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---

Read DESIGN.md. Search the catalog (`catalog/components.json`, or `node scripts/find.mjs <query>`). Open `local_path` under `components/external` and import that file. Apply the tokens in `app/globals.css`.

Then read TUTORIAL.md. Prefer `components/ui` and `components/kit` before an external import. Hard rules: Geist Mono everywhere, 6px radius, 4px gaps, 28px controls, dark layered greys, no borders, no shadows. White only on the focus ring and the active item. Hover uses the spotlight border (`Spotlight` / `useCursorBorder`). Loading uses `Skeleton` shimmer. Minimal copy. Icons are Lucide, `size-4`, muted unless active. Wrap product pages in AppShell. BoardUI Pro has no source in this repo. Restyle EasyUI and BoardUI files to these tokens before shipping them.
